{title: Nayi Raah}
{alternate_title: नई राह}
{artist: Guitar Chords Demo}
{language: Hindi}
{key: C}
{capo: 0}
{difficulty: beginner}
{strumming: D DU UDU}
{rights: original}
{rights_notes: Original demonstration lyrics and chord progression.}

{start_of_verse}
[C]Subah ki roshni [G]khidki pe aaye
[Am]Dil ki ye dhun [F]mujhko bulaaye
[C]Chhote se kadam [G]nayi si raah
[F]Aage badhun main [C]liye ek chaah
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[C]Chalte rahein hum [G]apni dagar
[Am]Sapnon ka ho [F]ek naya safar
{end_of_chorus}